--- !u!1001 &8130459876425332574
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.size
      value: 27
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[0].Text
      value: Are you guys alright, meow? I think we might not be strong enough for
        this fight!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[1].Text
      value: "The dragon isn\u2019t even awake, it just rolling over caused us this
        much damage."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[2].Text
      value: I still have one health left, let me back at him.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[3].Text
      value: "The dragon doesn\u2019t seem threatened or even mildly perturbed by
        your attacks..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[4].Text
      value: The party is heavily wounded and starts to pass out in front of the
        dragon.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[5].Text
      value: "It's going to eat us when it wakes up, meow! I don\u2019t want to die
        yet! "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[6].Text
      value: There must be something we can do!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[7].Text
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[8].Text
      value: A few moments pass and you realise that you are still conscious, and
        mysteriously your wounds have been healed.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[9].Text
      value: What happened?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[10].Text
      value: Gillbert? You healed us, meow! I thought we were all going to die!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[11].Text
      value: No... I would never do something like that...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[12].Text
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[13].Text
      value: 'Anyways, look guys the dragon is waking up. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[14].Text
      value: "Who\u2019s poking me while I\u2019m trying to sleep? Leave me alone."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[15].Text
      value: I was just trying to take a nap after a good meal.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[16].Text
      value: A meal? A meal of what? Cheese?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[17].Text
      value: "Cheese? No, gross, I\u2019m lactose intolerant."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[18].Text
      value: What was it that you ate then?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[19].Text
      value: "One of the pigs, from the sty over there. And maybe you next if you
        don\u2019t leave me alone."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[20].Text
      value: "Well, if the thief isn\u2019t the pigs, and it isn\u2019t the dragon,
        then who is it?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[21].Text
      value: Hmmmm... And I wonder who the mysterious person who healed us was, meow...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[22].Text
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[23].Text
      value: "Let\u2019s head back to town for now. Perhaps the mayor might have
        another lead for us."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[24].Text
      value: 'After surviving that close encounter with the dragon, you feel braver
        and stronger. The party has levelled up! '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[25].Text
      value: "Although you didn\u2019t defeat the terrifying beast, looking out for
        eachother has strengthened your bonds, you have learned The Power of Friendship."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[26].Text
      value: You wander onwards to face the last part of your journey.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1220581904049086502, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[0].Character
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 42983cc6bc6894058b76e65e2d009577,
        type: 2}
